WEBVTT

00:00:04.828 --> 00:00:08.958
A narrow receipt can still contain a long basket of supermarket items.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:18.986
Edit the sample sale data with a realistic grocery basket.

00:00:27.755 --> 00:00:33.365
Switch to the continuous roll view and confirm the items and totals fit the 58 millimeter receipt.

00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:45.676
Preview the ESC POS output before sending it to a thermal printer.
